  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-url-new-0000001111685200#section10647983",
      "text": "上传文件至AppGallery Connect前需要先调用此接口获取上传地址，包括图片、视频、PDF等文件。接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员、运营。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-url-new-0000001111685200#section10647983",
      "text": "此接口当前支持获取上传地址的应用软件包格式包括APK、AAB、RPK、EXE（Windows应用软件包）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-url-new-0000001111685200#section236517415165",
      "text": "本接口支持使用Service Account方式、API客户端方式和OAuth客户端方式，区别请参见使用入门。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-url-new-0000001111685200#section236517415165",
      "text": "Service Account方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-url-new-0000001111685200#section236517415165",
      "text": "API客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-url-new-0000001111685200#section236517415165",
      "text": "OAuth客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "响应参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-url-new-0000001111685200#section1093665",
      "text": "获取的上传URL有效期约为5分钟，超时后此URL将失效，需重新调用接口获取上传URL。"
    },
    {
      "section": "响应参数",
